Author: ahuzmeza <32289581+ahuzmeza@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Mon Oct 26 21:05:03 2026 +0200

    Qwen3-TTS: keep the ICL prompt in the talker's dtype (#315)
    
    The speaker encoder returns a float32 embedding. Concatenating it into
    the bfloat16 codec prefix promotes the prefill, the KV cache and every
    decode step to float32. Cast it to the prefix dtype at the concat, as
    mlx-audio does since Blaizzy/mlx-audio#879.
    
    1.7B Base 8-bit, ICL with Tests/media/conversational_a.wav and its
    transcript, Release CLI on an M2 Pro: 11.7 -> 25.3 tokens/s.

